WEBVTT

00:00:00.773 --> 00:00:06.025
<v><b>Dominic:</b></v> We followed our dream. My wife and I always wanted to live abroad.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:12.582
But Miriam and I both work in the UK – she’s a doctor and I’m a designer –

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:16.596
and we have two small children, Sacha and Elena.

00:00:17.431 --> 00:00:25.346
Then an American university, Duke in Durham, North Carolina, asked Miriam to go and work there for a year.

00:00:26.219 --> 00:00:31.101
At first, we weren’t sure what to do. There were so many questions.

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:33.436
What about Sacha’s school?

00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:35.808
What do we do with our house?

00:00:36.395 --> 00:00:39.052
But finally, we decided to go!